    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d561">

                <pb facs="0625" n="545" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg545"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Raikes</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-06"><hi rendition="#italic">September 6,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Personal.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Chargé</hi>: Confirming my note to you of
                    the 22d ultimo, I now take pleasure in quoting what follows from a report made
                    by the commanding officer of the U. S. S. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cincinnati</hi> at La Guaira and forwarded by the Secretary of the Navy on
                    the 2d instant: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Having learned that a British subject was being held in involuntary
                            service in the revolutionary army, I requested the general, Pablo
                            Guzman, to release him, which was done.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
